# Regression for flaw-and-Add.md A-2: myon.string.substring range check used
# `start + len` which overflowed (signed integer UB) and wrapped negative,
# slipping past the bounds check and driving an OOM exit(70).  After the fix a
# huge start/len must return a clean "range out of bounds" error value.
module myon.stdio
module myon.string

r, e = myon.string.substring(str("hello"), 4611686018427387904, 4611686018427387904)
myon.print(e)
myon.print(myon.string.length(r))
